    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental Slime is a puzzle platformer game where you use the power of the elements to solve puzzles, interact with the world around you and unravel mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/554a88c146fafbdde1a2cebc53ce1930.avif?t=1747460343\" width=800 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/e3a981ca14d0ddf26eefbb8ed893d49d.poster.avif?t=1747460343\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/e3a981ca14d0ddf26eefbb8ed893d49d.webm?t=1747460343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/e3a981ca14d0ddf26eefbb8ed893d49d.mp4?t=1747460343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...are key to solutions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to use them cleverly and interact with the environment. <i>Is that a wooden obstacle?</i> Just burn it with a fire slime. <i>Is that a water pool filled with monsters?</i> Just electrocute and stun them for a while with a lightning slime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/bc731474d34d3045660186d5bc99ea27.avif?t=1747460343\" width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/87c6e97e8a2617fb6be0c2761d964992.poster.avif?t=1747460343\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/87c6e97e8a2617fb6be0c2761d964992.webm?t=1747460343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/87c6e97e8a2617fb6be0c2761d964992.mp4?t=1747460343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...experience are just like the classic ones.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to timing and make use of the platforms. There are many different types of platforms you can use in harmony. For example; Static, Moving, Vanishing, Slippery, Breakable, Sticky, Conveyor, Hazardous, Floating, Teleporting and Teleporter platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/bae82b755c1c5a9746868209e036479b.avif?t=1747460343\" width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/22b80989e02e027e558a10200ca3c52c.poster.avif?t=1747460343\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/22b80989e02e027e558a10200ca3c52c.webm?t=1747460343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540580/extras/22b80989e02e027e558a10200ca3c52c.mp4?t=1747460343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...can be mind-blowing. Just focus on finding the missing pieces!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the surroundings, find the missing pieces, unlock doors, activate electrical devices, and complete the level. If you can't find the answer, our scientist will help you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
